			"Message": "feat(Scheme): Add CSS-as-JS shim for vscode-file scheme handling\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "204f51e4b2ea706a8247605d05466c67d1af4f76"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-27T21:27:11Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				859,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Add cocoon:notify handler and webview notification channels\n\nAdd a new `cocoon:notify` IPC handler as a fire-and-forget companion to the existing `cocoon:request` bridge. This handles one-way wire methods (webview.message, webview.dispose, webview.viewState, etc.) where the extension host doesn't reply, avoiding the 30s request timeout penalty when the renderer just wants to push data into Cocoon.\n\nAlso extend the webview notification relay in MountainVinegRPCService to handle `webview.updateView` and `webview.reveal` in addition to the existing setTitle, setIconPath, and setHtml. These new channels route through the WebviewLifecycle notification handler for proper translation to Sky's kebab-case channel registry.\n\nThis completes the one-way communication path complementing the request/response RPC bridge added in the prior commit.",
			"SHA": "c3883463d357d421647827bc32d7e8435cf36d48"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-27T21:02:53Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				859,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Translate webview.setHtml to kebab-case for Sky channel alignment\n\nAdd suffix mapping in WebviewLifecycle to convert VS Code's camelCase\nwire format (`setHtml`) to Sky's canonical kebab-case channel registry\n(`set-html`). The translation happens before emitting so events like\nHTML assignment correctly route to sky://webview/set-html where Sky's\nlistener expects them. Other methods pass through unchanged since\nSky uses camelCase for setTitle and setIconPath.\n\nThis follows the event channel corrections in the prior commit that\naligned Terminal, Debug, StatusBar, Progress, and Output channels.",
			"SHA": "728ab19ea1e973ad206d97d450e44ab69ab15ee4"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-27T20:53:06Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				859,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Add cocoon:request IPC handler for extension host RPC bridge\n\nIntroduce a generic renderer→Cocoon RPC bridge in WindServiceHandlers to allow Sky-side bridges (e.g., webview.resolveView) to dispatch requests into the extension host.\n\nThe handler accepts params in the shape `[Method, Payload]`, forwards the request to Cocoon via `Vine::Client::SendRequest` with a 30s timeout, and returns the response verbatim. On failure, it returns a stringified error so the renderer can fall back to its alternative path (CustomEvent fan-out for legacy observers).\n\nThis enables extension callbacks like `resolveWebviewView` to flow through Mountain's IPC layer rather than requiring separate channel registrations for each bridge type.",
			"SHA": "4044ae0a4523b3c5369965aa3b380fb030ce482a"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-27T19:54:02Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				859,
				5
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Implement debug session tracking and DAP adapter spawning\n\nAdd DebugSessionEntry struct and DebugSessions map to DebugState for lifecycle management of active debug sessions. Implement StartDebugging to spawn executable adapters (node, chrome, etc.) with stdin/stdout/stderr pipes, parse DAP frames from adapter stdout, and emit messages on `sky://debug/dap-message`. Implement SendCommand to route DAP requests to the spawned adapter's stdin or fall back to reverse-RPC for inline-implementation adapters. Implement StopDebugging to send DAP disconnect and unregister the session.\n\nAlso implement OnSaveCustomDocument in CustomEditorProvider to reverse-RPC to the extension sidecar via `$onSaveCustomDocument`, replacing the stub.\n\nFix char-aware truncation in WindServiceHandlers and OutputChannelAppend to avoid panics when slicing multi-byte UTF-8 codepoints (e.g., `•` in SCM progress messages).",
			"SHA": "0b6ac619c4e7e5af9b04d1cd45731dbdd4959176"
		}
	],
	"TimeStamp": 1779544409174
}